      "message": "feat(app): Trochoidal slot operation (2D mill, typed centre line)\n\nA new appended kind (OpType::TrochoidalSlot, id and digest tag 39, in\nthe 2D mill section) authored like the Slot by two endpoints and a\nwidth, with the loop numbers: loop width (auto = the room), forward\nstep, max engagement, return (microlift height / retract), smoothing\nradius, cutting / return / plunge feeds, climb. Created and edited\nthrough CreateOperation / EditOperationParams (undoable), verified\nagainst the slot's stadium, filed as the `trochoidal_slot` params arm -\nappended the probe's way, so no pin, digest tag or format rung moves.\nA small parameter page (Geometry / Heights / Passes / Feeds) reuses the\nSlot's icon.\n\nPins: create / edit undo-redo, generate verifies clean and posts G03,\na too-narrow channel refused by name, project round trip, golden CL and\nFanuc NC (trochoid_slot_small). Decisions in\ndocs/decisions/220-trochoidal-slot.md.\n\nRefs #220\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
